Good afternoon Evan

Thank you for this email and the one this morning.

I don=E2=80=99t need to view the locker you received, I really (I apologise=
, I should have been more clearer as to why I asked) just wanted to see if =
it in anyway was a like for like space for the one you previously had.  Whi=
ch it isn=E2=80=99t.  Would you say the work started in the storage area ar=
ound February 1, 2024 or before?

I have attached the claim form as well, there is no statue to say when you =
have to file, there is a $50.00 filing fee (payable by cheque or if done in=
 person by debit/credit card) however in your claim the plus costs part inc=
ludes the $50.00 filing fee if you are successful in your claim.  The forms=
 do need to be printed out on legal size, so I can mail this to you as well=
 if it is easier.

Thank you

David Maclean
Residential Tenancies Officer
Residential Tenancies Branch
200-155 Carlton St
Winnipeg, MB R3C 3H8
Phone: 204-945-2484
Fax: 204-945-6273

